Upstream-Name: iree-rocket
Upstream-Contact: Boyd Johnson <boyd@boundarybit.io>
Source: https://github.com/boydjohnson/iree-rocket
Comment:
 The orig tarball is assembled by debian/make-orig.sh: this repository, the
 IREE submodule (iree-build/iree-src) with only the five of its own
 submodules the compiler build uses (llvm-project, torch-mlir without its
 nested externals, flatcc, benchmark, googletest), and the Rust crates
 vendored under vendor/. The stanzas below cover the top-level license of
 each of those trees. LLVM and IREE carry a few further files under other
 permissive licenses (see their own LICENSE and NOTICE files); run
 licensecheck over the unpacked orig tarball before submitting this
 anywhere that audits it file by file.

